    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>14级 伏击</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 暗影界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 106；''重伤'' 53</span><span>''先攻'' +18</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 28，''强韧'' 26，''反射'' 28，''意志'' 25</span><span>''侦查'' +16</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 7</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">鸦后之影（黯蚀）</div>\n<div class=description>该影灵黎明杀手的近战攻击对看不到该影灵黎明杀手的目标造成 2d6 额外黯蚀伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">阴霾笼罩</div>\n<div class=description>一个生物在被阴霾笼罩期间，攻击骰受到-2 减值且从医疗效果只能获得一半增益。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}反曲刀（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+19 vs. AC<br>命中：2d6+6 伤害，且目标被阴霾笼罩（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}暗影打击（黯蚀）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+19 vs. AC<br>命中：以一个被阴霾笼罩的敌人为目标；2d8+6 黯蚀伤害，且目标目盲（豁免终止）。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">影跃（瞬移）✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>该影灵黎明杀手瞬移 3 格且变成虚体直到其下回合开始。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 杂技+19，隐秘+19</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+12）</span><span>''敏捷'' 24（+14）</span><span>''感知'' 18（+11）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+10）</span><span>''智力'' 14（+9）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+7）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，2 把反曲刀</span></div></div>\n</div>",
